# 💙 Your Safety Comes First

Some of what you shared suggests you may be dealing with a situation that could
put your safety at risk. You are not alone, and help is available right now — you
do not need a lawyer or any money to reach it.

**If you are in immediate danger, call 911.**

You can reach trained, confidential help any time:

